; Opera - remove the force install policy, Windows, per-user.
; @last-edited: 2026-11-15 UTC+7.
; @title: extension force install removal - deletes exactly the value the install file wrote.
; @state: per-user policy (HKCU). Removes only value "1", never the ExtensionInstallForcelist key itself and never your own entries under other numbers.
; @dependencies: it undoes extension-forceinstall.reg; the extension itself then stays until you remove it at chrome://extensions (or brave://, edge://extensions).

Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Google\Chrome\ExtensionInstallForcelist]
"1"=-

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\ExtensionInstallForcelist]
"1"=-

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\BraveSoftware\Brave-Browser\ExtensionInstallForcelist]
"1"=-
